Credits (prior art; ideas borrowed, no code copied so far)

vm2lxc is a fresh implementation, but it stands on ideas first worked out in
two MIT-licensed projects. Thank you to their authors:

  ArMaTeC/lxc-to-vm          https://github.com/ArMaTeC/lxc-to-vm
    (vm-to-lxc.sh: host-side offline conversion, the exclude list, per-distro
     network fix-ups, dry-run and resume ideas)

  thushan/proxmox-vm-to-ct   https://github.com/thushan/proxmox-vm-to-ct
    (the first-boot cleanup unit gated on ConditionVirtualization=container,
     the fstab/boot-package cleanup list, DietPi handling)

If code from either project is ever copied into this repository, their MIT
copyright notices will be added here verbatim, as the MIT license requires.
